  {
    "id": 8737389674651,
    "title": "Mutton Boneless Pickle",
    "handle": "mutton-boneless-pickle",
    "description": "Rich, bold and deeply satisfying — our Mutton Boneless Pickle is handcrafted for those who want the most indulgent non-veg pickle experience. Made with fresh tender mutton, slow-cooked with traditional Andhra spices and cold-pressed groundnut oil, this is a pickle that is as premium as it gets. Chef Venkatesh uses only fresh mutton — never frozen — and cooks it with the patience and care that a great pickle deserves. The result is tender, deeply flavoured mutton pieces in a rich, spiced oil that transforms any meal into a feast. Why our Mutton Boneless Pickle is different: Fresh tender boneless mutton — never frozen Slow-cooked with traditional Andhra spices Cold-pressed groundnut oil — never refined oil Zero preservatives, FSSAI certified Handcrafted in s",
    "html": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Rich, bold and deeply satisfying — our Mutton Boneless Pickle is handcrafted for those who want the most indulgent non-veg pickle experience. Made with fresh tender mutton, slow-cooked with traditional Andhra spices and cold-pressed groundnut oil, this is a pickle that is as premium as it gets.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Chef Venkatesh uses only fresh mutton — never frozen — and cooks it with the patience and care that a great pickle deserves. The result is tender, deeply flavoured mutton pieces in a rich, spiced oil that transforms any meal into a feast.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Why our Mutton Boneless Pickle is different:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Fresh tender boneless mutton — never frozen</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Slow-cooked with traditional Andhra spices</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Cold-pressed groundnut oil — never refined oil</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Zero preservatives, FSSAI certified</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"></li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Handcrafted in small batches</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Best enjoyed with:</strong> Hot steamed rice and ghee, warm roti or chapati. Perfect as a centrepiece at festive meals and family gatherings.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in a cool dry place. Always use a clean dry spoon. Refrigerate after opening. Consume within 3 months.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><em>Tip: Serve at room temperature for the full flavour — cold mutton pickle straight from the fridge loses its aroma. Always stir well before serving.</em></p>",
