  {
    "id": 8737389838491,
    "title": "Chicken Boneless Pickle",
    "handle": "chicken-boneless-pickle",
    "description": "There are chicken pickles — and then there is our Chicken Boneless Pickle. Handcrafted by Chef Murala Venkatesh using fresh boneless chicken, bold Andhra spices and cold-pressed groundnut oil, this is a pickle that has earned its place as one of the most loved non-veg pickles in India. Every piece of chicken is carefully cleaned, cooked with freshly ground spices, and slow-matured in oil until the flavours penetrate deep into every bite. The result is a rich, intensely spiced chicken pickle that tastes like it came straight from an Andhra grandmother's kitchen. Why our Chicken Boneless Pickle is different: Fresh boneless chicken — never frozen Authentic Andhra recipe by Chef Venkatesh Cold-pressed groundnut oil — never refined oil Freshly ground spices in every batch Zero preservatives, FS",
    "html": "<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">There are chicken pickles — and then there is our Chicken Boneless Pickle. Handcrafted by Chef Murala Venkatesh using fresh boneless chicken, bold Andhra spices and cold-pressed groundnut oil, this is a pickle that has earned its place as one of the most loved non-veg pickles in India.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\">Every piece of chicken is carefully cleaned, cooked with freshly ground spices, and slow-matured in oil until the flavours penetrate deep into every bite. The result is a rich, intensely spiced chicken pickle that tastes like it came straight from an Andhra grandmother's kitchen.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Why our Chicken Boneless Pickle is different:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\">\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Fresh boneless chicken — never frozen</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Authentic Andhra recipe by Chef Venkatesh</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Cold-pressed groundnut oil — never refined oil</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Freshly ground spices in every batch</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\">Zero preservatives, FSSAI certified</li>\n<li class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Best enjoyed with:</strong> Hot steamed rice and ghee, warm roti, chapati or as a spicy side with curd rice.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><strong>Storage:</strong> Store in a cool dry place. Always use a clean dry spoon. Refrigerate after opening. Consume within 3 months.</p>\n<p class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"><em>Tip: Stir well before serving and bring to room temperature for the richest, most aromatic flavour experience.</em></p>",
